# Generate Example Cards

## Summary
Host command — create new cards populated with sample data. Available to
cards and commands via the runtime loader, and to AI assistant rooms as a
tool.

## Example
```ts
import GenerateExampleCardsTool from '@cardstack/boxel-host/commands/generate-example-cards';

let result = await new GenerateExampleCardsTool(commandContext).execute({
  /* input fields */
} as any);
```
`commandContext` comes from `@context.commandContext` inside any card
format. In an AI room the same tool is invoked by name (action verb: Generate Example Cards).
